{"id": "2344360", "name": "מד\"ר סדר ראשון הומוגני 1", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 0.1, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "dot", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "[", "inversetrig": "cos-1", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 0, "questiontext": "<p></p><p></p><p>נתונה המשוואה הדיפרנציאלית</p><p></p><p></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">\\[{{CT:0}}\\]</p><p></p><p dir=\"rtl\" style=\"direction: rtl;\">א. הציבו \\(v=\\frac{y}{x}\\) וקבלו מד\"ר פרידה (עבור הפונקציה \\(v\\)) מהצורה&nbsp;</p><p dir=\"rtl\" style=\"direction: ltr; text-align: center;\">\\({{CT:1}}=f(v)g(x)\\)</p><p dir=\"rtl\" style=\"direction: rtl; text-align: right;\">הזינו:</p><p dir=\"rtl\" style=\"direction: ltr; text-align: center;\">\\(f(v)g(x)=\\)[[input:ans1]] [[validation:ans1]]</p><p dir=\"rtl\" style=\"direction: ltr; text-align: center;\"></p><p dir=\"rtl\" style=\"direction: rtl;\">(שימו לב בהזנת \\(f(v)\\) להשתמש במשתנה \\(v\\) ולא \\(v(x)\\)).&nbsp;</p><p dir=\"rtl\">ב. בעזרת סעיף קודם מצאו פתרון למד\"ר \\(y(x)\\) המקיים: \\(y({{CT:2}})={{CT:3}}\\)</p><p dir=\"rtl\" style=\"direction: ltr; text-align: center;\">\\(y(x)=\\)[[input:ans2]] [[validation:ans2]]</p><p></p>", "generalfeedback": "", "specificfeedback": "[[feedback:prt1]]<br>[[feedback:prt2]]<br>", "prtcorrect": "Correct answer, well done.", "prtpartiallycorrect": "Your answer is partially correct.", "prtincorrect": "Incorrect answer.", "inputs": [{"name": "ans1", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 35, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}, {"name": "ans2", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 35, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}], "prts": [{"name": "prt1", "value": 1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "", "firstnode": 0